282
00:19:41,540 --> 00:19:44,580
I had a good time today, Robbie.

283
00:19:44,680 --> 00:19:45,940
Me, too.

284
00:19:46,700 --> 00:19:48,740
Why don't we do it again?

285
00:19:49,200 --> 00:19:51,280
