294
00:20:13,100 --> 00:20:18,360
No, Dad, and certainly not without the right magic.

295
00:20:33,400 --> 00:20:37,480
Maybe we can spend some time together next weekend.

296
00:20:37,800 --> 00:20:38,280
Maybe.

297
00:20:38,420 --> 00:20:40,900
Maybe.

298
00:20:41,100 --> 00:20:44,580
Maybe we can spend some time together.

299
