Maybe we can stay at home.

300
00:20:47,460 --> 00:20:49,420
Maybe get away.

301
00:20:49,620 --> 00:20:51,780
Oh, yeah.

302
00:20:52,040 --> 00:20:55,620
Because I really like to be with you.

303
00:20:55,820 --> 00:20:58,660
I know we'll have fun whatever we do.

304
00:20:58,860 --> 00:21:04,440
And maybe we can do it again another day.

305
00:21:06,140 --> 00:21:09,200
Maybe we can go bowling.

306
00:21:09,200 --> 00:21:13,640
And golf would be fun to play.

307
00:21:14,120 --> 00:21:16,680
Maybe we can play baseball.

308
00:21:16,880 --> 00:21:21,780
Or go fishing on a summer... fishing on a summer day.

309
00:21:21,980 --> 00:21:23,200
What do you say we get back to our fishing?

310
00:21:23,220 --> 00:21:26,420
What do you say?

311
00:21:26,620 --> 00:21:28,220
What do you say?

312
00:21:28,420 --> 00:21:32,040
What do you say we get back to our fishing?

313
00:21:32,060 --> 00:21:34,140
What do you say we fish?

314
00:21:34,340 --> 00:21:37,080
That's what we want to do.

315
00:21:38,920 --> 00:21:43,260
So let's get back to it right away.

316
00:21:43,460 --> 00:21:46,420
We don't want to waste this beautiful day.

317
00:21:46,620 --> 00:21:51,120
