Why don't we find the time?

322
00:22:03,840 --> 00:22:06,280
Hey, what do you say?

323
00:22:08,480 --> 00:22:11,940
There are lots of things that we can do,

324
00:22:12,140 --> 00:22:15,560
and I enjoy spending time with you.

325
00:22:15,760 --> 00:22:18,200
So why don't we do it again

326
00:22:18,320 --> 00:22:20,340
